   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering newly arrived female internally displaced persons to ensure  food security and peace consolidation in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to improve the living conditions of IDPs, mainly newly arrived ones, and their host communities through supporting their livelihoods as well as food security. In order to achieve this objective, the proposed project will provide quick-impact training in entrepreneurship development, Village Savings and Loans Association (VSLA), as well as post-harvest handling of groundnuts and the other oil seeds. Based on training needs and market surveys, other food production training would be also considered.</narrative>
  </description>
